doggui.talentinfo.bedfinder=While this beast perches on your noggin, your berth shall be marked with ink! Toss a bone to get 'em up there. Ranges further as they find their sea legs.
doggui.talentinfo.blackpelt=Strikes with the fury of a storm! Deals more damage as the beast grows stronger.
doggui.talentinfo.guarddog=The beast learns to parry blows like a master duelist!
doggui.talentinfo.hunterdog=Gives a chance to double the booty from any foe the beast strikes down!
doggui.talentinfo.hellhound=The beast breathes the fires of Davy Jones! Master it, and the flames shall never harm 'em.
doggui.talentinfo.wolfmount=Ride your beast like a sturdy vessel! They jump higher as they gain more notches on their collar.
doggui.talentinfo.packpuppy=Grants the beast a hold to carry your loot! Open the hold with a timber plank in hand.
doggui.talentinfo.pillowpaw=The beast lands as soft as a cloud. At full rank, they float like a ghost!
doggui.talentinfo.quickhealer=Mends their wounds faster! Resting at the dock (sitting) doubles the speed.
doggui.talentinfo.creepersweeper=Warns of those green powder-kegs before they blow your ship to splinters!
doggui.talentinfo.doggydash=Catch the wind! Your beast moves faster when chasing prey or carrying a rider.
doggui.talentinfo.fisherdog=Your beast dives for treasures of the deep! At max rank, they breathe like a fish.
doggui.talentinfo.happyeater=Your beast can stomach even the nastiest of rations, including rotten flesh and raw fish.
doggui.talentinfo.pestfighter=Crushes the silver-rats that hide in the stone.
doggui.talentinfo.poisonfang=Bites with a viper's sting! Can even cure the Captain if you give 'em a spider's eye.
doggui.talentinfo.shepherddog=Hold some wheat to make your beast round up the livestock like a true bosun!
doggui.talentinfo.rescuedog=When your health is in the locker, your beast shall mend your wounds for a price of hunger.
doggui.talentinfo.puppyeyes=Charms the land-lubbing villagers into handing over their booty!
doggui.talentinfo.swimmerdog=Ride your beast through the waves! Grants the Captain vision in the murky depths.

