doggui.modeinfo.tactical=The beast follows but only strikes when you signal with the Admiral's Seal.
doggui.modeinfo.aggressive=The beast follows and strikes anyone who dares cross the Captain!
doggui.modeinfo.berserker=The beast strikes any scallywag that gets too close, no warning given!
doggui.modeinfo.docile=The beast follows peacefully, waiting to play with their marrow bone.
doggui.modeinfo.patrol=The beast guards the perimeter between set markers and strikes all monsters.

